DESCRIPTION:La Rondine by Giacomo Puccini June 12-28 TICKETS La Rondine is
  a tragicomic opera by Puccini about Magda\, a Parisian courtesan who leav
 es her wealthy patron\, Rambaldo\, for a life of true love with a young ma
 n named Ruggero\, a chance encounter at a nightclub. She disguises herself
  to meet Ruggero\, and they elope to the French Riviera\, but their idylli
 c life is shattered when her past catches up to them\, forcing her to choo
 se between her love and Ruggero's social ruin. Mary Chun\, Music Director 
